BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  # The Myth of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  In the beginning, two rivers flowed from the Sacred Mountain - the River of Giving and the Riv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    er of Receiving. Each was ruled by a guardian spirit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  The Guardian of Giving possessed five silver coins each dawn. When she cast her coins into the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (     waters, they multiplied threefold by the time they reached the Guardian of Receiving's doma) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    in. But the Guardian of Receiving held the power to decide: keep all the coins, or return so) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    me upstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  For many seasons, fear ruled both guardians. The Giver held tight to her coins, sending nothin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    g. The Receiver, when given anything, returned nothing. Both remained poor, and the land wit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    hered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  Then came a great drought. In desperation, the Guardian of Giving released all five coins, tru) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    sting completely. They multiplied to fifteen. The Guardian of Receiving, moved by this faith) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    , returned ten coins upstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  The Giver now held ten coins instead of five. The Receiver held five instead of none. Both had) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (     prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  From that day forward, they continued this sacred exchange. The waters flowed freely, and the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    valley below bloomed eternal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  The ancestors taught: *Trust extended returns multiplied. Reciprocity honored creates abundanc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    e for all.*) Tj ET
