BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      For many seasons, fear ruled both guardians. The Giver held tight to her coins, sending no) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        thing. The Receiver, when given anything, returned nothing. Both remained poor, and the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        land withered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
