BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Two Wells) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a barren valley. Each had a sacr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        ed well, but the wells held a secret: water poured into the First Well would flow underg) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        round and emerge tripled from the Second Well.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      The First Village discovered this magic but faced a dilemma. To send water meant their own) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (         well would run lower. Yet the Second Village, receiving the tripled blessing, could cho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        ose to return water-or keep it all.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      At first, the First Village sent nothing, fearing betrayal. Both suffered through drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      Then a brave elder poured one bucket into the well. Three buckets emerged in the Second Vi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        llage. Grateful, they returned two buckets through the underground channels. The First V) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        illage rejoiced-they had sent one bucket but received two in return!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      Trust grew like roots intertwining beneath the earth. The First Village sent more; the Sec) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        ond Village returned generously. Both wells overflowed with abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      The villages learned that prosperity flows not from hoarding, but from the courage to give) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         and the honor to reciprocate. The magic multiplies what is shared, but only wisdom and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        fairness allow both to drink deeply.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      Thus, the valley bloomed eternal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
