BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      # The Myth of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      In the beginning, two rivers flowed from the Sacred Mountain - the River of Giving and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (         River of Receiving. Each was ruled by a guardian spirit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      The Guardian of Giving possessed five silver coins each dawn. When she cast her coins into) Tj ET
