BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      The Northern Village held the power to give; the Southern Village held the power to return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        . Neither could prosper without the other's honor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      Generations passed in stalemate. Some northerners sent mere drops, testing but never trust) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        ing. Some southerners returned nothing, or too little, proving the cynics right. The fou) Tj ET
