BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      In the first cycle of trust, the Keeper of Dawn planted four of five starseeds-a courageou) Tj ET
