BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      When the Keeper of Dawn planted seeds in the cosmic soil, they grew threefold by the time ) Tj ET
